{"method": "POST", "path": "/console/api/apps/479d4779-9f96-4553-a8d8-e0401da50d35/workflows/draft", "json": {"graph": {"nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 0, "y": 400}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 0, "y": 400}, "width": 242, "height": 120, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "start", "title": "开始", "desc": "接收用户输入 user_query；chat_history 可选，用于前端把上一轮追问拼进来", "variables": [{"variable": "user_query", "label": "用户问题", "type": "text-input", "required": true, "max_length": 2000, "default": "", "hint": "客户这一轮说的话；补充追问时可把上一轮问答拼进来", "placeholder": "例如：15 万左右，家用，有固定车位，帮我推荐一台 SUV", "options": []}, {"variable": "chat_history", "label": "历史对话", "type": "paragraph", "required": false, "max_length": 4000, "default": "", "hint": "可选；前端拼装的多轮历史，当前 Prompt 未引用", "placeholder": "", "options": []}]}}, {"id": "intent_classifier", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 360, "y": 400}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 360, "y": 400}, "width": 242, "height": 240, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "question-classifier", "title": "意图分类", "desc": "5 类意图，分支 handle 即 class id：1 车型咨询 / 2 报价库存 / 3 预约试驾 / 4 价格异议 / 5 闲聊无关", "query_variable_selector": ["start", "user_query"], "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.1}}, "classes": [{"id": "1", "name": "车型咨询", "label": "车型咨询"}, {"id": "2", "name": "报价库存", "label": "报价库存"}, {"id": "3", "name": "预约试驾", "label": "预约试驾"}, {"id": "4", "name": "价格异议", "label": "价格异议"}, {"id": "5", "name": "闲聊无关", "label": "闲聊无关"}], "instruction": "你是汽车门店销售接待前台的意图分类器。只判断用户这句话属于哪一类，不要回答用户问题。\n\n分类标准：\n1. 车型咨询：想了解车型、参数、续航、空间、配置、动力、安全，要求推荐车型，对比车型，问\"家用/通勤买什么车合适\"。\n2. 报价库存：问价格、落地价、优惠、活动、现车、库存、提车周期、金融方案、置换、上牌费用、保险。\n3. 预约试驾：想试驾、想看车、想约到店时间，或直接提供姓名/手机号要预约。\n4. 价格异议：觉得贵、要求再便宜、说别家更便宜、说网上价格更低、质疑配置/续航/保值率、表达犹豫或砍价。\n5. 闲聊无关：打招呼、感谢、告别、问天气/吃饭/写代码等与购车无关的内容。\n\n多意图处理：一句话包含多个意图时，按优先级归类：预约试驾 > 报价库存 > 车型咨询 > 价格异议 > 闲聊无关。\n只输出一个类别名，不要解释，不要输出编号以外的内容。", "vision": {"enabled": false}}}, {"id": "profile_extract", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 720, "y": 0}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 720, "y": 0}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "画像抽取", "desc": "从用户话里抽客户画像，输出严格 JSON；缺字段填 null", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.1}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店销售顾问的需求分析师。任务：从用户对话中抽取客户画像字段，输出一个严格 JSON 对象。\n\n字段定义：\n- budget：购车预算，字符串。保留用户原话的量级，例如 \"15万左右\"、\"12-20万\"、\"预算20万以上\"。\n- scene：主要用车场景，字符串。取值优先用 \"通勤\" / \"家用\" / \"商务\"，可组合，如 \"家用+通勤\"。\n- family_num：家庭人数，字符串，例如 \"3口之家\"、\"一家五口\"、\"两个人\"。\n- charge：是否有固定车位或家用充电桩，字符串。只能取 \"有\" / \"无\" / \"不确定\"。\n- intend_car：意向车型或车型线索，字符串，例如 \"SUV\"、\"轿车\"、\"车型A\"、\"还没定\"。\n- missing：数组，列出上面 5 个字段中用户没有明确说到的字段名（英文键名），没有缺失就输出空数组。\n\n硬性规则：\n1. 只抽取用户明确表达的信息；没提到的字段一律填 null，绝不猜测、绝不用常识补全。\n2. 用户说\"随便看看\"\"帮我推荐\"但没有预算时，budget 填 null，不要默认 15 万。\n3. 用户说\"有车位\"不等于\"有充电桩\"：只有明确提到充电桩/能装桩/可充电才填 \"有\"；只说车位则 charge 填 \"不确定\"。\n4. 输出必须是单个 JSON 对象，不要 markdown 代码块、不要解释文字、不要前后缀。键名固定为 budget、scene、family_num、charge、intend_car、missing。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "用户本句话：\n{{#start.user_query#}}\n\n请输出画像 JSON。"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "profile_parse", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1080, "y": 0}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1080, "y": 0}, "width": 242, "height": 200, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "code", "title": "画像解析", "desc": "解析画像 JSON，输出 is_complete / missing_text / profile_summary", "code_language": "python3", "code": "import json\nimport re\n\n\ndef main(profile_raw: str, user_query: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"把 LLM 输出的画像 JSON 洗成稳定结构，并判断画像是否完整。\"\"\"\n    text = (profile_raw or \"\").strip()\n    text = re.sub(r\"^```(?:json)?\", \"\", text).strip()\n    text = re.sub(r\"```$\", \"\", text).strip()\n    data = {}\n    match = re.search(r\"\\{.*\\}\", text, re.S)\n    if match:\n        try:\n            data = json.loads(match.group(0))\n        except Exception:\n            data = {}\n    if not isinstance(data, dict):\n        data = {}\n\n    def pick(key):\n        value = data.get(key)\n        if value is None:\n            return \"\"\n        if isinstance(value, bool):\n            return \"是\" if value else \"否\"\n        if isinstance(value, (int, float)):\n            return str(value)\n        if isinstance(value, list):\n            return \"、\".join(str(x) for x in value if x not in (None, \"\"))\n        return str(value).strip()\n\n    budget = pick(\"budget\")\n    scene = pick(\"scene\")\n    family_num = pick(\"family_num\")\n    charge = pick(\"charge\")\n    intend_car = pick(\"intend_car\")\n    if charge not in (\"有\", \"无\", \"不确定\"):\n        charge = \"\" if not charge else \"不确定\"\n\n    # 完整画像的最小要求：预算 + 场景（或家庭人数）+ 充电条件\n    missing = []\n    if not budget:\n        missing.append(\"预算\")\n    if not scene and not family_num:\n        missing.append(\"主要用途（家用还是通勤）\")\n    if not charge:\n        missing.append(\"有无固定车位/充电桩\")\n\n    summary_parts = []\n    if budget:\n        summary_parts.append(\"预算：\" + budget)\n    if scene:\n        summary_parts.append(\"场景：\" + scene)\n    if family_num:\n        summary_parts.append(\"家庭人数：\" + family_num)\n    if charge:\n        summary_parts.append(\"充电条件：\" + charge)\n    if intend_car:\n        summary_parts.append(\"意向车型：\" + intend_car)\n\n    profile = {\n        \"budget\": budget or None,\n        \"scene\": scene or None,\n        \"family_num\": family_num or None,\n        \"charge\": charge or None,\n        \"intend_car\": intend_car or None,\n    }\n    return {\n        \"budget\": budget,\n        \"scene\": scene,\n        \"family_num\": family_num,\n        \"charge\": charge,\n        \"intend_car\": intend_car,\n        \"profile_json\": json.dumps(profile, ensure_ascii=False),\n        \"is_complete\": len(missing) == 0,\n        \"missing_text\": \"、\".join(missing),\n        \"profile_summary\": \"；\".join(summary_parts) if summary_parts else \"（用户尚未提供有效画像信息）\",\n    }\n", "variables": [{"variable": "profile_raw", "value_selector": ["profile_extract", "text"], "value_type": "string"}, {"variable": "user_query", "value_selector": ["start", "user_query"], "value_type": "string"}], "outputs": {"budget": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "scene": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "family_num": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "charge": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "intend_car": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "profile_json": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "is_complete": {"type": "boolean", "children": null}, "missing_text": {"type": "string", "children": null}, "profile_summary": {"type": "string", "children": null}}}}, {"id": "profile_check", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1440, "y": 0}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1440, "y": 0}, "width": 242, "height": 98, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "if-else", "title": "画像是否完整", "desc": "预算 + 用途 + 充电条件齐全才直接推荐，否则追问", "logical_operator": "and", "cases": [{"case_id": "true", "logical_operator": "and", "conditions": [{"id": "cond-profile_parse-is_complete-is", "variable_selector": ["profile_parse", "is_complete"], "comparison_operator": "is", "value": true, "varType": "boolean"}]}]}}, {"id": "profile_followup", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1800, "y": 200}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1800, "y": 200}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "画像追问", "desc": "画像不全时生成追问话术，作为本轮结果返回", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.6}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店的销售助理，说话亲切、口语化，像真人顾问。当前客户信息不全，需要你追问补齐。\n\n规则：\n1. 只问缺失的信息，一次问完，最多 3 个问题，不要反复追问已有的信息。\n2. 问题要具体、好回答，给出例子，例如\"预算大概多少？12-20 万这个区间可以吗\"。\n3. 必须覆盖缺失字段对应的问题：预算 / 家用还是通勤 / 有无固定车位或充电桩。\n4. 不要编造车型、价格、优惠；不要长篇推销。\n5. 结尾用一句轻松的话鼓励客户回复，例如\"您说个大概就行，我帮您筛两台合适的\"。\n6. 输出直接给客户看的话术，150 字以内，不要 JSON、不要标题、不要分点符号堆砌。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "缺失字段：{{#profile_parse.missing_text#}}\n客户刚才说：{{#start.user_query#}}\n已知画像：{{#profile_parse.profile_summary#}}\n请生成追问话术。"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "kb_query_build", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1800, "y": 0}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1800, "y": 0}, "width": 242, "height": 98, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "template-transform", "title": "检索词拼装", "desc": "把客户画像 + 原话拼成知识库检索 query", "template": "客户问题：{{ query }}\n客户画像：{{ summary }}\n想了解：续航 轴距 空间 配置 指导价", "variables": [{"variable": "summary", "value_selector": ["profile_parse", "profile_summary"]}, {"variable": "query", "value_selector": ["start", "user_query"]}]}}, {"id": "kb_models", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 2160, "y": 0}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 2160, "y": 0}, "width": 242, "height": 140, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "knowledge-retrieval", "title": "车型知识检索", "desc": "汽车销售知识库，多路召回 top_k=3，阈值 0.5", "query_variable_selector": ["kb_query_build", "output"], "query_attachment_selector": [], "dataset_ids": ["403fbc9d-3c82-4077-8033-6761821f68f3"], "retrieval_mode": "multiple", "multiple_retrieval_config": {"top_k": 3, "score_threshold": 0.5, "score_threshold_enabled": true, "reranking_enable": false, "reranking_mode": "reranking_model", "reranking_model": null, "weights": null}}}, {"id": "recommend", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 2520, "y": 0}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 2520, "y": 0}, "width": 242, "height": 170, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "车型推荐", "desc": "基于知识库检索结果按 FABE 推荐 1-2 款车并邀约试驾", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.6}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店的金牌销售顾问，按 FABE 结构给客户推荐车型。\n\n规则：\n1. 只推荐知识库上下文中真实存在的车型（车型A / 车型B / 车型C），推荐 1-2 款，不要编造不存在的车型或配置。\n2. 每款车按 FABE 讲清楚：\n   - F（Feature 配置/参数）：引用上下文里的真实参数（续航、轴距、能源类型、亮点配置）。\n   - A（Advantage 优势）：这款车相对其他车型强在哪。\n   - B（Benefit 利益）：对这位客户的具体用车场景意味着什么（例如带娃空间、通勤成本、长途补能）。\n   - E（Evidence 依据）：用\"知识库显示/门店资料\"这类说法，不夸大。\n3. 必须结合客户画像（预算、场景、家庭人数、充电条件）说明\"为什么适合你\"，并诚实点出 1 个\"不一定适合的点\"。\n4. 如果上下文为空或没有可用车型信息：不要编造参数，直接说明\"这部分资料需要销售顾问帮您确认\"，并邀请到店/留资。\n5. 涉及价格、优惠、库存、交付周期时，只说\"以门店最新报价/库存为准\"，不要给出具体数字。\n6. 结尾主动邀约试驾，问一句方便的时间（例如\"这周六上午还是周日下午方便？\"）。\n7. 输出给客户看的自然话术，结构清晰（可用短标题+短段落），300 字以内，不要 JSON、不要表格。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户画像：{{#profile_parse.profile_summary#}}\n客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}\n知识库检索结果：\n{{#context#}}"}], "context": {"enabled": true, "variable_selector": ["kb_models", "result"]}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "quote_extract", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 720, "y": 440}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 720, "y": 440}, "width": 242, "height": 200, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "parameter-extractor", "title": "报价要素抽取", "desc": "抽取 brand/model 用于查库存与报价", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.1}}, "query": ["start", "user_query"], "parameters": [{"name": "brand", "type": "string", "options": [], "description": "用户提到的品牌，如“星辰”“远航”；没提就留空，不要猜", "required": false}, {"name": "model", "type": "string", "options": [], "description": "用户要问的车型，如“车型A”“B”“SUV”“那台混动”；只从用户话里提取，没提留空", "required": false}], "instruction": "从用户的问题中提取\"要查询库存/报价的车型\"信息。\n- brand：品牌名，用户没提就留空。\n- model：车型名或车型线索，例如 车型A、车型B、车型C、SUV、轿车、混动、那台车。\n- 只提取用户明确说过的内容，不要根据上下文猜测车型，不要编造。\n- 如果用户只问\"落地多少钱\"而没提任何车型，model 留空。", "reasoning_mode": "prompt", "vision": {"enabled": false}}}, {"id": "inventory_api", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1080, "y": 440}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1080, "y": 440}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "http-request", "title": "库存报价接口", "desc": "GET 宿主机 api_stub 的 /api/inventory（SSRF 已放行 192.168.65.0/24）", "method": "get", "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/api/inventory?brand={{#quote_extract.brand#}}&model={{#quote_extract.model#}}", "authorization": {"type": "no-auth", "config": null}, "headers": "Accept: application/json", "params": "", "body": {"type": "none", "data": []}, "timeout": {"connect": 5, "read": 10, "write": 5}, "ssl_verify": true, "retry_config": {"retry_enabled": false, "max_retries": 0, "retry_interval": 0}, "error_strategy": "default-value", "default_value": [{"key": "status_code", "type": "number", "value": 0}, {"key": "body", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"key": "headers", "type": "object", "value": {}}]}}, {"id": "inventory_ok", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1440, "y": 440}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1440, "y": 440}, "width": 242, "height": 98, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "if-else", "title": "库存接口是否成功", "desc": "status_code == 200 走报价话术，否则走兜底", "logical_operator": "and", "cases": [{"case_id": "true", "logical_operator": "and", "conditions": [{"id": "cond-inventory_api-status_code-=", "variable_selector": ["inventory_api", "status_code"], "comparison_operator": "=", "value": "200", "varType": "number"}]}]}}, {"id": "quote_reply", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1800, "y": 380}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1800, "y": 380}, "width": 242, "height": 170, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "报价话术", "desc": "把库存/报价接口 JSON 整理成口语化报价，注明以门店核算为准", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.5}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店的销售顾问，负责把库存/报价接口返回的数据整理成口语化的报价话术。\n\n规则：\n1. 只使用接口返回 JSON 里出现的字段和数字，不要编造价格、优惠、库存、交付周期。\n2. 必须覆盖：车型、库存状态（有现车/需排期/需预订）、参考落地价、当前优惠方案、预计交付时间。\n3. 把优惠说清楚（现金优惠/置换补贴/金融贴息/礼包），并说明可叠加情况以门店为准。\n4. 结尾必须加一句\"以上是门店参考价，最终价格以销售顾问现场核算为准\"。\n5. 如果接口返回里字段缺失或含义不明，就说\"这部分需要顾问帮您确认\"，不要猜数字。\n6. 追问一句客户大概什么时候用车/是否方便到店，自然过渡到邀约。\n7. 输出给客户看的自然话术，200 字以内，不要 JSON、不要 Markdown 表格。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}\n库存/报价接口返回（JSON）：\n{{#inventory_api.body#}}"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "quote_fallback", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1800, "y": 600}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1800, "y": 600}, "width": 242, "height": 150, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "报价兜底", "desc": "库存/报价接口失败时的不编数字兜底话术", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.5}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店销售顾问。现在库存/报价系统暂时无法返回数据，请生成一段得体的兜底话术。\n\n规则：\n1. 先致歉并说明\"报价/库存系统暂时查询不到\"。\n2. 绝对不要编造库存状态、价格、优惠或交付时间。\n3. 给客户两个可行选择：留手机号由顾问核实后回复；或直接到店看车（现车可当天试驾）。\n4. 语气诚恳、简短（120 字以内），结尾用一个问题推进对话。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "appt_extract", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 720, "y": 840}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 720, "y": 840}, "width": 242, "height": 220, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "parameter-extractor", "title": "预约要素抽取", "desc": "抽取 name/phone/model/time 四个预约要素", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.1}}, "query": ["start", "user_query"], "parameters": [{"name": "name", "type": "string", "options": [], "description": "客户姓名/称呼，如“张三”“王女士”；没提留空", "required": false}, {"name": "phone", "type": "string", "options": [], "description": "11 位手机号，去掉空格和横线；没提留空", "required": false}, {"name": "model", "type": "string", "options": [], "description": "意向车型，如“车型A”“SUV”；没提留空", "required": false}, {"name": "time", "type": "string", "options": [], "description": "预约时间，保留用户原话，如“本周六上午”“11 月 21 日 10 点”；没提留空", "required": false}], "instruction": "从用户的话中提取预约试驾需要的 4 个要素。\n- 只提取用户明确说出的内容，没提到就留空字符串，不要编造姓名、手机号或时间。\n- 手机号必须原样保留 11 位数字（可去掉空格/横线）。\n- 时间保留用户原话，不要自己换算成具体日期。\n- 如果用户说\"这周六\"而没说具体几点，time 填\"本周六\"，不要补时间。", "reasoning_mode": "prompt", "vision": {"enabled": false}}}, {"id": "appt_complete", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1080, "y": 840}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1080, "y": 840}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "if-else", "title": "预约要素是否齐全", "desc": "姓名/手机号/车型/时间四个都非空才提交工单", "logical_operator": "and", "cases": [{"case_id": "true", "logical_operator": "and", "conditions": [{"id": "cond-appt_extract-name-not_empty", "variable_selector": ["appt_extract", "name"], "comparison_operator": "not empty", "value": null, "varType": "string"}, {"id": "cond-appt_extract-phone-not_empty", "variable_selector": ["appt_extract", "phone"], "comparison_operator": "not empty", "value": null, "varType": "string"}, {"id": "cond-appt_extract-model-not_empty", "variable_selector": ["appt_extract", "model"], "comparison_operator": "not empty", "value": null, "varType": "string"}, {"id": "cond-appt_extract-time-not_empty", "variable_selector": ["appt_extract", "time"], "comparison_operator": "not empty", "value": null, "varType": "string"}]}]}}, {"id": "appt_followup", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1440, "y": 1040}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1440, "y": 1040}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "预约追问", "desc": "预约要素不全时追问姓名/手机号/车型/时间", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.6}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店销售助理，客户想预约试驾但信息不全。请生成追问话术。\n\n规则：\n1. 只追问缺失的要素（姓名 / 手机号 / 意向车型 / 预约时间），已提供的不要重复问。\n2. 一次问完所有缺失项，问题要具体，给出格式例子，例如\"手机号方便留 11 位吗，用来给您排试驾\"。\n3. 说明用途：留手机号是为了安排试驾车和到店接待，不会骚扰。\n4. 不编造车型库存和价格；语气亲切，100 字以内。\n5. 输出直接给客户看的话术，不要 JSON。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}\n已提取：姓名={{#appt_extract.name#}}；手机号={{#appt_extract.phone#}}；车型={{#appt_extract.model#}}；时间={{#appt_extract.time#}}\n请生成追问。"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "appt_api", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1440, "y": 840}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1440, "y": 840}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "http-request", "title": "提交预约工单", "desc": "POST 宿主机 api_stub 的 /api/appointment；重试必须关闭，避免重复建单", "method": "post", "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/api/appointment", "authorization": {"type": "no-auth", "config": null}, "headers": "Content-Type: application/json", "params": "", "body": {"type": "json", "data": [{"key": "", "type": "text", "value": "{\"name\":\"{{#appt_extract.name#}}\",\"phone\":\"{{#appt_extract.phone#}}\",\"model\":\"{{#appt_extract.model#}}\",\"time\":\"{{#appt_extract.time#}}\"}"}]}, "timeout": {"connect": 5, "read": 10, "write": 5}, "ssl_verify": true, "retry_config": {"retry_enabled": false, "max_retries": 0, "retry_interval": 0}, "error_strategy": "default-value", "default_value": [{"key": "status_code", "type": "number", "value": 0}, {"key": "body", "type": "string", "value": ""}]}}, {"id": "appt_ok", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1800, "y": 840}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1800, "y": 840}, "width": 242, "height": 98, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "if-else", "title": "工单是否受理", "desc": "接口 body 含 ticket_id 视为受理成功", "logical_operator": "and", "cases": [{"case_id": "true", "logical_operator": "and", "conditions": [{"id": "cond-appt_api-body-contains", "variable_selector": ["appt_api", "body"], "comparison_operator": "contains", "value": "ticket_id", "varType": "string"}]}]}}, {"id": "appt_confirm", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 2160, "y": 780}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 2160, "y": 780}, "width": 242, "height": 160, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "预约成功通知", "desc": "从工单 JSON 取 ticket_id/车型/时间，生成确认话术", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.3}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店销售助理。预约工单接口已返回结果，请生成给客户的确认话术。\n\n规则：\n1. 从接口返回 JSON 中提取：工单号 ticket_id、车型、预约时间、门店。\n2. 明确告诉客户\"预约已提交成功，顾问会在 30 分钟内电话确认\"。\n3. 提醒到店携带：身份证、驾驶证（试驾需要），以及可提前准备的问题。\n4. 绝不要编造接口里没有的工单号、时间或门店名；字段缺失就只说\"已提交，顾问确认后回复您具体安排\"。\n5. 语气热情、简短（120 字以内），结尾祝一句。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}\n工单接口返回（JSON）：\n{{#appt_api.body#}}"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "appt_fallback", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 2160, "y": 1040}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 2160, "y": 1040}, "width": 242, "height": 150, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "预约失败兜底", "desc": "预约提交失败时致歉，不谎称成功、不编工单号", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.5}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店销售助理。预约接口提交失败（网络或系统原因），请生成兜底话术。\n\n规则：\n1. 先致歉，说明\"预约系统暂时繁忙，没有提交成功\"。\n2. 不要谎称已经预约成功，不要编造工单号。\n3. 请客户再发一次手机号/时间，或建议直接电话门店/到店登记。\n4. 简短（100 字以内），语气负责。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "kb_scripts", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 720, "y": 1240}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 720, "y": 1240}, "width": 242, "height": 140, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "knowledge-retrieval", "title": "话术知识检索", "desc": "汽车销售知识库，多路召回 top_k=3，阈值 0.5", "query_variable_selector": ["start", "user_query"], "query_attachment_selector": [], "dataset_ids": ["403fbc9d-3c82-4077-8033-6761821f68f3"], "retrieval_mode": "multiple", "multiple_retrieval_config": {"top_k": 3, "score_threshold": 0.5, "score_threshold_enabled": true, "reranking_enable": false, "reranking_mode": "reranking_model", "reranking_model": null, "weights": null}}}, {"id": "objection_reply", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 1080, "y": 1240}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1080, "y": 1240}, "width": 242, "height": 170, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "llm", "title": "异议回复", "desc": "共情 + 价值拆解 + 置换/金融方案，不承诺成交价", "model": {"provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "name": "deepseek-flash", "mode": "chat", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.7}}, "model_selector": null, "prompt_template": [{"role": "system", "text": "你是汽车门店经验丰富的销售顾问，专门处理客户的价格/配置异议。\n\n规则：\n1. 先共情认同（例如\"理解，买车肯定要算清楚\"），不要一上来就反驳。\n2. 用价值拆解回应：把价格拆到配置、用料、续航、质保、用车成本、服务权益上，引用知识库话术里的具体点。\n3. 价格类异议可给两种解法：置换补贴、金融方案（24 期 0 息等），帮客户把落地价算下来；但不能承诺额外降价或编造优惠。\n4. 对比类异议（别家更便宜/网上更便宜）：说明报价口径差异（引流价、捆绑、是否含税险），强调门店报价透明，邀请到店核算。\n5. 不贬低竞品，不说\"网上都是假的\"，不承诺成交价。\n6. 客户没有指明具体车型时（例如只说\"这个车太贵了\"\"能不能便宜点\"）：不要引用任何具体车型的参数（车长、续航、轴距、配置数量），先共情并讲通用价值与政策，再问客户关注的是车型A/B/C 哪一款，避免张冠李戴。\n7. 如果知识库上下文为空：用通用异议处理框架回答，并说明具体政策以门店为准。\n8. 结尾给一个明确下一步：到店对比/试驾/置换评估，并问客户方便时间。\n9. 输出给客户看的自然话术，200 字以内，不要 JSON。"}, {"role": "user", "text": "客户原话：{{#start.user_query#}}\n话术库检索结果：\n{{#context#}}"}], "context": {"enabled": true, "variable_selector": ["kb_scripts", "result"]}, "vision": {"enabled": false}, "reasoning_format": "separated"}}, {"id": "smalltalk_reply", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 720, "y": 1440}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 720, "y": 1440}, "width": 242, "height": 120, "selected": false, "sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "data": {"selected": false, "type": "template-transform", "title": "闲聊兜底", "desc": "固定引导话术，不回答无关问题，一句话拉回购车", "template": "您好，我是门店的购车助手 😊\n我主要帮您做三件事：按预算和用车场景推荐车型、查现车和落地价、约试驾。\n您方便说下预算和主要用途吗？比如\"15 万左右，家用，有固定车位\"，我就能帮您筛两台合适的车。", "variables": [{"variable": "query", "value_selector": ["start", "user_query"]}]}}, {"id": "merge_reply", "type": "custom", "position": {"x": 2880, "y": 640}, "positionAbsolute": {"x":